{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25814","headline":"新楼诗二十首 望海亭 · 李绅","name":"新楼诗二十首 望海亭","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"乌盈兔缺天涯迥，鹤背松梢拂槛低。\n湖镜坐隅看匣满，海涛生处辨云齐。\n夕岚明灭江帆小，烟树苍茫客思迷。\n萧索感心俱是梦，九天应共草萋萋。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李绅","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_25814.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_25814","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}